      ],
      "imageSide": "right",
      "tone": "cream",
      "body": "All of them, alongside management, business, research, tech, and marketing teams, make up for the 20+ professionals that make sure we offer our unparalleled music notation services to as many musicians as possible. All over the world!\n\nAt the backbone of our services is our Transcription Team. Comprised of 60+ musicians who meticulously transcribe the hundreds of files we deliver each week by ear, note-for-note. With an adept and varied group of transcribers, each having their own specialty, we always have the right person for the job.\n\nWith this blend of talent, technology, and experience, we’re poised to take on nearly any project, no matter the level or scale. We’re here to facilitate your notation needs."
